sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employee
  participant C as IncidentController
  participant S as IncidentService
  participant F as IncidentFactory
  participant AC as AutoCategorizer
  participant P as PriorityStrategy
  participant SL as SlaService
  participant A as AssignmentStrategy
  participant I as Incident (State)
  participant EP as EventPublisher
  participant L as Audit / Notification / Dashboard listeners
  E->>C: POST /api/incidents
  C->>S: create(request)
  S->>F: create(request, reporter)
  F-->>S: Incident (NEW)
  S->>EP: IncidentCreated
  EP->>L: onEvent → audit row, notify reporter
  S->>AC: best(text)
  AC-->>S: Category + confidence
  S->>P: calculate(impact, urgency, criticality, users)
  P-->>S: P1, score, rationale
  S->>SL: apply(incident)  (find policy, start clock)
  S->>I: markClassified()  NEW→CLASSIFIED
  S->>A: select(context)
  A-->>S: best technician + reason
  S->>I: assignTo(tech)  CLASSIFIED→ASSIGNED
  S->>EP: IncidentAssigned
  EP->>L: audit, in-app + email (+SMS for P1), WebSocket push
  S-->>C: detail + possible duplicates
  C-->>E: 201 Created
